{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-04",
  "title": "Anguish Hangs O'er",
  "storyCode": "13-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b1ff83cd1d385a4b2e4910abef950a00dac046f53447edd902301744fbead14f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is a highly disconcerting environment, Doctor. We were in the thick of a forest only moments ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What laid before us became nothing alike as the fog settled in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A... convallis."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Is this all an illusion, Logos?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mirages are spin from nothingness. Their scenes are mere fictions in the mind, bound to return to nihil no matter how lifelike."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But this place is not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everything here truly did exist, once upon a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Constructing a 'mirage' like this requires not just intelligence and information, but time, and space."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's too difficult."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A bone whistle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, the whistle of the Banshees. It doesn't necessarily entail Originium Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When we were young, we'd learn it by the riverside. We'd sit among the underbrush, and wait still. Until great fin gobbled small bug, until fowlbeast snatched up great fin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That is when the bone whistle is played."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What's this scenery doing here? How do we get out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm trying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Originium Arts hasn't this power. The power this is of can only be something more ancient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it shouldn't come about in this battlefield at this moment, not on Londinium's periphery."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everything we're seeing and hearing could pass for real. Our squad is <i>not</i> in good condition. We need to up our vigilance."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos, what's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I say try to tear this landscape apart directly. It carries some risk, but it's the best solution."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know whether it'd be safe to leave this place, Ascalon."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll be leaving tomorrow, for Babel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're master of the Elegiac Court now. Remember to send Her Highness Theresa my greetings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It still doesn't feel real to me, Mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm too young to be master of a Royal Court."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now, now, what makes you say that? Anyone could see how remarkable you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Keep this safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your bone whistle. I've tuned it for you, and given it a Royal Court crest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And of course, a kiss full of magic too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Simply sound it, and all the Sarkaz will know it as the will of the Knell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mother, what should a Lord of the Banshees do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do what you believe you must."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I once talked to you about those... ravings of mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The fettered Sarkaz have no escape, just as the necklaces you used to weave together for me became naught but pieces in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yet what fetters us is our identity, to what we belong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The 'Royal Court', and perhaps, 'The King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But still you bestow this aspect on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our rotting bones will never again be given new life, should annihilation reach its destination."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And yet... that is the rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We sound the Knell for all, for others, for ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it is a necessary burden."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you feel our timeworn inheritance has been reduced to naught but a stepping stone to new life, then it is for you to ascertain that yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Supposing that does not change your mind—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—then 'from death comes new life'."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...*exhale*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My, my, now, well done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Banshee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh tender little Lord of the Banshees, for whom does your first fledgling Knell toll?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...For myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For the Royal Court that would rot, past and future all."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'What meaning is there in a stagnant landscape?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g8_wildernesswarcircle"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Vampire's witchcraft."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the Vampire could never construct the landscape we were just in. I fear there's some other presence helping him."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What is the Vampire planning to do with these Arts Circles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The loop here isn't even complete. But... some of its symbols are legible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'PURIFY'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's trying to affect our blood somehow. Affect Sarkaz blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This Artistry... is tied to the Sarkaz's power."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I told you they were real!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those ghosts were the real deal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Is that you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uhh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're that, uh, 'Doctor', right? I saw you once in the munitions factory in Highbury!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And the knocked-out Cautus, and... Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You were supplying goods to refugees in Norport."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How did you know that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't—Don't let it slip! I was just, uhh—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't think that Cautus girl is looking too good, is she? And your arm is all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I, um, I'm gonna guess you guys are... fine hanging out with these Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Weary Sarkaz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think we ended up back where we came. But did we do it for real this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fierce Sarkaz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've met enough haloed monster things for one day. This is out of whack."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Weary Sarkaz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Paprika, what are you talking to the ghosts for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fierce Sarkaz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One... in a hood, one unconscious bunny, and a Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No! Driver, they're real!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Driver'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As in real?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Driver'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blaagh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Driver'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miner, come check this out, it's real!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Miner'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your... your clothes must've cost some money, didn't they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Sarkaz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe take a closer look! No, never mind, trust you Ursus bumpkins not to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Miner'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Quit it with the 'ooh I'm from Kazdel' already, Shopkeep, like you matter! All you do there is run a grocery store!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Miner'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, wait, forgot, you sold your store so you come pick fights out here! Ha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Shopkeep'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shape UP a little! Stop getting carried away in front of people!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Shopkeep'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello, hahah... you may have met me in Kazdel before. My grocery store was a fairly popular one..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Shopkeep'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You... must be part of the Royal Court, yes? I can tell by your regalia... I take it you're the—Child of Soil and Stone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I am the Banshee."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Driver'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A boy Banshee? I thought Banshees were meant to be all girls?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Driver'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh. Never heard about any boy Banshee while I was in Kazimierz... uh, not that I mean to be impolite or, you know..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Driver'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Paprika, you're friends with celebrities like him and you never told us?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh... no, I dunno if we <i>know</i> each other..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you moving things?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where are you transporting these goods to? Aren't these ritual materials?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er... I don't really know how to explain. We're just patrolling along our route map, 'cause some Arts Circles might be a little damaged, and we need to repair them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Noble Banshee, sire, we won't cross the battlefield alive at this rate. I beg you, just let us go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I commandeer your transport squadron. We are on a special mission of the utmost nature, but were assailed en route. For your assistance, I will memorialize you forevermore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Shopkeep'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha, it'd be our honor to serve a member of the Royal Court, Your Highness!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Shopkeep'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just... being 'memorialized' by a death-tolling Banshee... doesn't seem like much of a fortune. Could you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here is your payment."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Shopkeep'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha! Thank you, sire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But our transport duty..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll explain to your superiors afterwards."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Miner'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A special mission? Why bring these two outbloods along?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...They are my captives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Captives? But you, um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay... but once this is over, you guys are gonna come see General Manfred with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For now, we'll go sort out some positions."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos, figure out a car for Ascalon too.\nThe Confessarii attack was no simple one. They and the Vampire were working together, but in the process, they estranged Amiya from the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, are you worrying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Closure and the Self-Salvation Corps troops don't have any suitable combat personnel between them. Kal'tsit's wounded. Shining's powerful, but the Confessarii are sure to have methods prepared just for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The state Amiya's in may not be curable with medication. What she needs most right now, before she comes to, is not to fall into the Confessarii's line of sight.\nOperating under this squad's support will be safer.\nI'll get Ascalon to back up Kal'tsit. We've got you here.\nBesides..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "These crystals... aren't just simple Originium."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
